{"html":"<h2 id=\"intercepting-requests\">Intercepting Requests</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Go to Proxy </li>\n<li>Click Intercept On</li>\n</ul>\n<p><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand Img1\"><img src=\"/hacker-docs/images/0af064a523db147a68240669.png\" alt=\"Img1\"></button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand Img2\"><img src=\"/hacker-docs/images/a06f2e9d1c640e0856b2fa65.png\" alt=\"Img2\"></button></p>\n<h2 id=\"manipulating-requests\">Manipulating Requests</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>You can enter your custom values by interacting with the Request body and manipulating/modifying it.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand Image3\"><img src=\"/hacker-docs/images/a460c325c9b7a534c7d5cd29.png\" alt=\"Image3\"></button></p>\n","toc":[{"id":"intercepting-requests","title":"Intercepting Requests","level":2},{"id":"manipulating-requests","title":"Manipulating Requests","level":2}]}